msgid "Creates a brand-new <0>PRODUCTION</0> Organization paired with this <1>DEVELOPMENT</1> one. Nothing is copied — no Accounts, no OAuth Clients, no Workspaces — the new Organization starts empty, with its own signing key and its own tenant issuer. This cannot be undone: once created, this Organization can never be paired with a different one."
