msgid "That value exceeds the system-wide maximum of <0>{0}</0> requests/minute."
msgstr "Ese valor supera el máximo del sistema de <0>{0}</0> solicitudes/minuto."

msgid "That would leave nobody able to manage members or roles in this Workspace. To go ahead anyway, type \"unassign\" in the field that replaces the Delete button below."
msgstr "Eso dejaría a nadie con capacidad para gestionar miembros o roles en este espacio de trabajo. Para continuar de todos modos, escribe «unassign» en el campo que sustituye al botón Eliminar de abajo."

msgid "That would leave nobody able to manage members or roles in this Workspace. To go ahead anyway, type \"unassign\" in the field that replaces their Remove button below."
